The command to go downstairs is shift->, not shift-<.  But if there is
actually a downstairs there then there must be a problem with your
installation, because Nethack should never generate a downstairs on
the level below the vibrating square level.

I don't know if magic mapping works on this floor.  The Sanctum level
does look a bit like the mines, but with lots of tough monsters.  Look
for a rectangular walled space surrounded by fire traps.  Your goal is
in there.

